From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:14:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1379/3799] soh: rename func_80AFFE24 ->
 EnSkj_SetupOfferHeartPiece

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: installs SKJ_ACTION_UNK14, the state that hands the player the Saria's Song heart piece.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Skj/z_en_skj.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Skj/z_en_skj.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Skj/z_en_skj.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Skj/z_en_skj.c
index 59c31c757..934858916 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Skj/z_en_skj.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Skj/z_en_skj.c
@@ -34,7 +34,8 @@ void EnSkj_SetupTalk(EnSkj* this);
 void EnSkj_SetupMaskTrade(EnSkj* this);
 void EnSkj_SetupWrongSong(EnSkj* this);
 void EnSkj_SetupAfterSong(EnSkj* this);
-void func_80AFFE24(EnSkj* this);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80AFFE24: installs SKJ_ACTION_UNK14, the state that hands the player the Saria's Song heart piece.
+void EnSkj_SetupOfferHeartPiece(EnSkj* this);  // was func_80AFFE24 [LLM:HIGH]
 void EnSkj_SetupPostSariasSong(EnSkj* this);
 void EnSkj_JumpFromStump(EnSkj* this);
 void EnSkj_SetupWaitForLandAnimFinish(EnSkj* this);
@@ -1043,7 +1044,7 @@ void EnSkj_SariaSongTalk(EnSkj* this, PlayState* play) {
         if (Flags_GetItemGetInf(ITEMGETINF_16)) {
             EnSkj_SetupWaitInRange(this);
         } else {
-            func_80AFFE24(this);
+            EnSkj_SetupOfferHeartPiece(this);  // was func_80AFFE24 [LLM:HIGH]
             if (GameInteractor_Should(VB_GIVE_ITEM_FROM_SKULL_KID_SARIAS_SONG, true, this)) {
                 Actor_OfferGetItem(&this->actor, play, GI_HEART_PIECE, EnSkj_GetItemXzRange(this),
                                    EnSkj_GetItemYRange(this));
@@ -1052,7 +1053,7 @@ void EnSkj_SariaSongTalk(EnSkj* this, PlayState* play) {
     }
 }
 
-void func_80AFFE24(EnSkj* this) {
+void EnSkj_SetupOfferHeartPiece(EnSkj* this) {
     EnSkj_SetupAction(this, SKJ_ACTION_UNK14);
 }
 
